@page "/docs"
@* "/" is routed here too until the marketing home page lands - then drop this line. *@
@page "/"
<PageTitle>Introduction - Blaizio</PageTitle>

<div class="space-y-10">
    <header class="space-y-3">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Introduction</h1>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">
            Headless Blazor primitives (<code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-sm">Blaizio.Base</code>)
            paired with pre-styled Tailwind components you own, copied into your project by the Blaizio CLI.
            Behaviour and accessibility live in the primitive; Tailwind v4 styling lives in the component.
        </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground">
            <div class="text-sm font-medium">Headless core</div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">ARIA + a <code>data-state</code> contract, zero CSS.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground">
            <div class="text-sm font-medium">Tailwind v4</div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Styled layer ships utility classes you resolve.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground">
            <div class="text-sm font-medium">Multi-theme</div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Any number of named token sets - try the switcher.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        Start with the <a class="font-medium text-foreground underline underline-offset-4" href="docs/components/separator">Separator</a>.
    </p>
</div>
